  "details": "Description\n\nI thought it was a old instance bug with a Furry hideout but It's happening in another 40 person instance, both are on the west coast. every single person's voice is clipping.  \n\nEdit: East coast friends plus as well\n\nReproduction Steps\n\njoin a 40-60 person instance on the west coast. That's it, just massive voice clipping it's almost painful. it sounds like having a connection problem but my connection is solid, no issue in a 100 person instance hosted on east coast. \n\nEdit: Had clipping issues on a Friends+  I made on the east coast now with a small 5 person instance.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: Quest pro)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p3-1939-4803d92ede-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-18_19-23-32.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_722c034e-7ea4-48e6-92d3-feb81d14d760/1/file)",
